# White Lotus Hideout: "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Lesson or Shrine spell" (CR 106.6, 205.3).
# Turn 3 the Hideout's {R} casts Firebending Lesson ({R}, an instant Lesson) at Bot2's Ornithopter, dealing 2: the restricted
# mana is spent on it and nothing is left in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
White Lotus Hideout
Firebending Lesson
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.White Lotus Hideout.Play
